{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以西结书","commonName":"以西结书","title":"以西结书","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"b300d2a00ef4238c256f8a9d29bc0a1d295803bb4dc8e9a92c0dd26615335564","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1271},"chapter":{"number":28,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["预言审判泰尔王"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“人子啊，你去告诉泰尔王，主耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘你心里高傲，说，我是神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我坐在海中神明的宝座上。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你虽然自以为像神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你不过是人，并非神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，你比但以理更有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"什么秘密都瞒不过你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你凭智慧和头脑发了财，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"金银装满了你的库房。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你靠高超的经商本领使财富大增，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因而变得心高气傲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，主耶和华说，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你自以为像神明，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使列国中最残暴的外族人来攻打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必拔刀毁坏你凭智慧得来的美物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"玷污你的荣美，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你坠入坟墓，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必惨死在大海中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在杀戮你的人面前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你还能自称为神明吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在杀你的人手中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不过是人，并非神明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你要像未受割礼的人那样死在外族人手中。’","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为我已经宣告，这是主耶和华说的。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["泰尔王的终局"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["“人子啊，你要为泰尔王唱哀歌，告诉他，主耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘你曾经是完美的典范，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充满智慧，美丽无瑕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾在上帝的伊甸园中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你曾佩戴各种宝石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有红宝石、黄玉、钻石、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"绿宝石、红玛瑙、碧玉、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蓝宝石、绿松石、翡翠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"底座镶嵌着精美的黄金，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些在你受造的那天都已经预备妥当。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我膏立你为看守约柜的基路伯天使。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你安置在上帝的圣山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在闪闪发光的宝石中行走。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从受造那天开始所行的纯全无过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但后来在你那里查出不义。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为贸易发达，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你便充满暴力，犯罪作恶。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，看守约柜的基路伯天使啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你当作污秽之物逐出上帝的山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从闪闪发光的宝石中除掉你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你因俊美而心高气傲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因辉煌而心智败坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我把你扔到地上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让你在列国的君王面前出丑。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你多行不义，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"交易不公，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亵渎了你的圣所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此我使火在你那里燃起，吞噬你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在众目睽睽之下把你烧成地上的灰烬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所有认识你的民族都因你而惊骇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你落得可怕的下场，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你将永远不复存在。’”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["预言审判西顿"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["耶和华对我说："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["“人子啊，你要面对西顿，说预言斥责她，"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["告诉她，主耶和华这样说，",{"text":"“‘西顿啊，我要与你为敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在你那里彰显我的荣耀。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要审判你，在你中间彰显我的圣洁，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那时，人们就知道我是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使瘟疫进入你境内，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"刀剑从四面八方临到你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被杀的人横尸城中，血流街头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样人们就知道我是耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["“‘藐视以色列人的邻邦必不再作刺他们的荆棘，伤他们的蒺藜，这样人们就知道我是主耶和华。’"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["“主耶和华说，‘我要把分散到列国的以色列人招聚起来，当着列国的面在他们身上彰显我的圣洁，那时他们要住在自己的土地上，就是我赐给我仆人雅各的地方。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["他们将在那里安然居住，兴建房屋，栽种葡萄园。我审判鄙视他们的四邻后，他们必安然居住。这样，他们便知道我是他们的上帝耶和华。’”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/28.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/29.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/EZK/27.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}